flowchart LR
    U[Student User]
    UI[Web UI]
    SR[Sync Route API]
    RL[Cooldown Middleware]
    Q[BullMQ Queue]
    W[Sync Worker]
    GC[GitHub Service]
    AC[Anti-Cheat Service]
    SC[Score Engine]
    RK[Rank Engine]
    MDB[(MongoDB)]
    RDS[(Redis Cache)]

    U --> UI
    UI -->|POST /api/sync| SR
    SR --> RL
    RL -->|allowed| Q
    Q --> W

    W -->|invalidate/read cache| RDS
    W -->|fetch metadata| GC
    GC --> RDS

    W --> AC
    AC --> SC
    SC --> RK

    RK -->|update rank| MDB
    SC -->|update score and breakdown| MDB
    AC -->|update flags| MDB

    UI -->|GET /api/sync/status| SR
    SR --> MDB
    SR --> UI
